Package: ExtractHybridV2
Type: Package
Title: EPA Hybrid V2 climate data
Version: 2.1.0
Author: Hyung Eum
Maintainer: Hyung Eum <hyung.eum@gov.ab.ca>
Description: Extracting the hybrid V2 climate dataset for target points or within a bounding box and a user-defined shape file.
    Whenever the hybrid climate dataset is updated, extending spatial extent and data length, this package will be also updated accordingly.
